bluejetty:00144466:ios.description:
Register online and open a Mastercard Platinum card with Diia without visiting a bank branch.
Use Pivdenny Online and make card-to-card transfers without any fees from Pivdenny Bank!
In Pivdenny Online app, the bank clients have access to:
- possibility to register all deposit programs of the bank for individuals: Premium, Profitable Plus, Mobile Deposit; 
- deposit operations: top up, partial withdrawal, auto prolongation, early termination; 
- statement generation in PDF and CSV formats;
- issuance of new virtual cards with account opening (for existing bank customers);
- re-issue of expired or blocked cards to existing accounts in the form of virtual cards;
- ability to support the Armed Forces of Ukraine by transferring funds to a special NBU account.
- transfers and payments between/from/to the own cards and accounts;
- purchase of currency at a favorable rate with placement on a deposit;
- replenishment of your mobile phone – Kyivstar, Vodafone, Lifecell;
- currency exchange transactions;
- quick and clear registration;
- secure login with Touch ID, Face ID, PIN;
- ability to configure security settings for authorization (Touch ID, Face ID, PIN);
- accounts and cards control;
- sorting of cards;
- card service operations (PIN-code setting, сard blocking/unblocking, activation, limit management);
- receipts for financial transactions;
- details of existing/card accounts;
- display of CVV2/CVC2-code of the card;
- history of operations on card accounts;
- push-messages for confirmation and information on transactions;
- saving the own cards for quick access to repeated operations;
- adding the cards to Apple Wallet for contactless payment;
- support Center available on Telegram, Viber and Messenger;
- scanning of the IBAN number when creating a money transfer;
- map with branches and ATMs of the bank, with the possibility of laying routes to them.
All you need:
- financial phone number you registered with the bank;
- activated Pivdenny bank card.

